Portable UIOP modules vendored from https://gitlab.common-lisp.net/asdf/asdf
Commit 29d098f9121c804af0d525f0f64318bc069591db (UIOP 3.3.7.4).
License: LICENSE.texinfo (MIT); upstream copyright notices are preserved.

Changes: package.lisp imports Valtan's package-local nickname API from SYSTEM;
common-lisp.lisp recognizes Valtan and its Unicode support;
os.lisp allows browsers without inventing an OS, and expands OS-COND to a
runtime conditional. filesystem.lisp uses the Node backend for validated
recursive directory removal. Valtan backends and the reduced driver are separate files.
Includes package, utility, version, os, pathname, filesystem, stream,
launch-program and run-program. The last two upstream files are unchanged;
valtan-run-program.lisp supplies synchronous execution through Node spawnSync
while retaining upstream stream processors, temporary files and error handling.
Asynchronous LAUNCH-PROGRAM, ASDF, Lisp image/build control and configuration
discovery are not implemented. OS-backed operations require Node.js.
